Description: Provides preprocessing and differential expression analysis 
    functions for RNA-seq count data. The package supports raw count input 
    checking, low-count gene filtering, library-size, TMM, and DESeq2-based 
    normalization options. It provides local pooled error-based ANOVA for 
    small-sample multi-group analysis, conventional gene-wise one-way ANOVA 
    for larger sample sizes, automatic method selection based on group sample 
    size, pooled bin-wise IQR outlier trimming, and optional upper-quantile 
    regression-based variance trend estimation.
